lt if nobody answers: report the absolute difference and let the reader decide,\nbecause a tolerance chosen here is a bound nobody stated.\n","owner":"trace","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:cross-harness-portability"}],"scope":[{"confidence":"inferred","path":"crates/edge/aep-cli"},{"confidence":"inferred","path":"crates/observe/trace-spec"}],"status":"draft","summary":"Two transcripts checked against one specification, reported as what each did differently, so a harness swap is judged by behaviour rather than by both exit codes being zero.","tags":["trace"],"title":"protocol trace diff: two runs of one specification, compared"},"lifecycle_state":"draft"},"owner":"trace","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:cross-harness-portability"}],"scope":[{"confidence":"inferred","path":"crates/edge/aep-cli"},{"confidence":"inferred","path":"crates/observe/trace-spec"}],"summary":"Two transcripts checked against one specification, reported as what each did differently, so a harness swap is judged by behaviour rather than by both exit codes being zero.","tags":["trace"],"title":"protocol trace diff: two runs of one specification, compared"},"id":"ent-142610b4b97779b0d4a547d306237ba5","lifecycle_state":"draft","revision":5,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["story","ent-142610b4b97779b0d4a547d306237ba5"]}]